  <name>RUN R08 Hill 8x90</name>
  <description>Bakke Tjeldbergtind prep. — IMPORT: TP only accepts cycling ZWO — this file is sportType=bike so Library import works. After import: open workout → Build → set sport to Run → convert intensity to % Threshold Pace (keep the same % numbers). Power values are already % of run threshold (easy ~78%, threshold 100%).</description>
